⚡🇪🇺🇨🇦 The draft declaration of the EU-Canada summit on October 29-30 in Montreal provides for cooperation on artificial intelligence, critical raw materials, and LNG, as well as negotiations for Canadian participation in Erasmus+, Horizon Europe, and Galileo.

A study on LNG exports to Europe and greater integration of financial markets are also planned.

