⚡🇺🇸🇮🇷  US Secretary of State Marco Rubio demanded on Monday that the Iranian delegation to the UN General Assembly leave the country immediately after bilateral settlement negotiations stalled, Axios reported, citing sources.

According to the sources, the White House though on Monday morning that talks with Iran could yield some progress but later in the day it became clear that the talks had reached an impasse.

